              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Why: float(2^53 + 1) == 2^53."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Above 2^53 floats are 2 apart,"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "so two measurements become one."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1e16 or 1e308 as floats are fine:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "no conversion happens."
                }
